{"unit_id":"wodongx123__dsh-qq-notify#card-zh","repo":"wodongx123/dsh-qq-notify","commit":"ecb83b197bb75e7fab84def9cffdf8499866663f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-qq-notify 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 QQ 通知插件，通过本机 NapCat 机器人调用 OneBot HTTP API。它在 DSH 中注册消息发送、连接状态、机器人启停、NapCat 检测与扫描、配置查看修改和安装指引工具，并提供设置面板管理 QQ 号码、API 端口与 NapCat 目录。适合希望从 DSH 会话向 QQ 主号发送私聊通知并管理本地 NapCat 的用户。需要本机 NapCat、已登录的机器人账号和接收通知的 QQ 主号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:240-407","client.js:356-410"]}
{"unit_id":"wodongx123__dsh-qq-notify#card-en","repo":"wodongx123/dsh-qq-notify","commit":"ecb83b197bb75e7fab84def9cffdf8499866663f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-qq-notify sends QQ messages through a local NapCat bot. DSH tools send private messages, check bot status, manage NapCat, find installations, and edit settings. A Web panel also manages configuration and sends test notifications. Requires a logged-in QQ bot and recipient account.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:240-407","client.js:356-410"]}
